      "summaryZh": "Claude 博客宣布其托管代理平台新增三项功能：梦想模式、成果导向和原生多代理编排。梦想模式允许代理在后台模拟场景以改进决策；成果导向将目标分解为可衡量的成果；多代理编排支持多个代理协作完成复杂任务。这些功能旨在提升代理的自主性和效率。",
      "summaryEn": "Claude Blog announces three new features for its managed agent platform: dreaming mode, outcome orientation, and native multi-agent orchestration. Dreaming mode allows agents to simulate scenarios in the background to improve decision-making; outcome orientation breaks goals into measurable outcomes; multi-agent orchestration enables multiple agents to collaborate on complex tasks. These features aim to enhance agent autonomy and efficiency.",
